     👉  Federal Reserve Policy Expectations:\n\n
     ▢  Stronger economic data reduced market expectations for aggressive rate cuts in 2025.\n
     ▢  Before this data, many traders anticipated at least 3 rate cuts in 2025, starting in March.\n
     ▢  However, after these better-than-expected economic reports, bond yields rose, and expectations for early rate cuts diminished.\n
     ▢  Impact on Crypto: Since Bitcoin and other cryptocurrencies often benefit from lower interest rates, a delay in cuts caused a price drop across major digital assets."

